#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:5
#: 2616e731406c4b5ebf6f5d16f211113a
msgid "**ARCHIVED ARTICLE**"
msgstr "**已归档文章**"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:9
#: 611894276d4a4fa2ac272caa2fb99094
msgid ""
"ArduPilot no longer supports make.  The following article should be "
"referencing our new build system, `waf` and needs updating."
msgstr "ArduPilot 已不再支持 make。以下文章应引用我们新的构建系统 `waf`，需要更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:13
#: 170af6b4c363450a84fdbfde27f06438
msgid "ARCHIVED:Editing/Building with Eclipse on Windows"
msgstr "归档：在 Windows 上使用 Eclipse 编辑/构建"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:15
#: 3bd26165f7a243098442c45c5021a7c1
msgid ""
"This article shows how you can setup Eclipse for editing and building "
"binaries for Pixhawk/STM32 boards.  It is not possible to build on Windows "
"for other boards."
msgstr "本文介绍如何设置 Eclipse 以编辑代码并为 Pixhawk/STM32 板构建二进制文件。在 Windows 上无法为其他板构建。"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:19
#: b21ef150c9bd4807a9e8fd5d66205f3d
msgid ""
"Ensure that you have Java (32-bit) installed before Eclipse can run or else "
"you'll get Java Error Code 13 due to 32/64-bit version mismatch. Java can be"
" installed `here <https://www.java.com/en/>`__."
msgstr ""
"确保在运行 Eclipse 之前已安装 Java（32位），否则会因 32/64 位版本不匹配而出现 Java 错误代码 13。Java 可在 `此处 "
"<https://www.java.com/en/>`__ 安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:22
#: 30e4774300894cddab2824ef8dbbb992
msgid "Preconditions"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:24
#: d0ec7aa1bb98405495fa615af3dcfb6a
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions in :ref:`Building for Pixhawk on Windows with Make "
"<building-px4-with-make>` to download the required source code (*ardupilot*,"
" *PX4Firmware* and *PX4NuttX*) and toolchain."
msgstr ""
"按照 :ref:`在 Windows 上使用 Make 为 Pixhawk 构建 <building-px4-with-make>` "
"中的说明下载所需源代码（*ardupilot*、*PX4Firmware* 和 *PX4NuttX*）及工具链。"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:27
#: 178bd4a571954c7e9551fe93689ab009
msgid ""
"The *PX4 toolchain* includes a preconfigured version of Eclipse that has "
"been set up for ArduPilot development."
msgstr "*PX4 工具链* 包含一个已为 ArduPilot 开发预配置的 Eclipse 版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:31
#: 060f9fc5c74e4adf9db1404be617a219
msgid "Starting Eclipse"
msgstr "启动 Eclipse"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:33
#: 5576acd8727c4df6b50a909318aa0a04
msgid ""
"Start Eclipse using the *PX4 Eclipse* link installed with the *PX4 "
"toolchain*. The link can be accessed from either:"
msgstr "使用随 *PX4 工具链* 一同安装的 *PX4 Eclipse* 链接启动 Eclipse。该链接可通过以下方式访问："

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:36
#: 88999f8e6fd04f4e889a066a8bdef18a
msgid ""
"The Windows Start menu (**Start \\| All Programs \\| PX4 Toolchain \\| PX4 "
"Eclipse**), or"
msgstr "Windows 开始菜单（**开始 \\| 所有程序 \\| PX4 工具链 \\| PX4 Eclipse**），或"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:38
#: dd44e0a5005d40a38258c53b4cd7a8cb
msgid ""
"You can directly run the file "
"**C:\\\\Pixhawk_Toolchain\\\\toolchain\\\\msys\\\\1.0\\\\px4_eclipse.bat**"
msgstr "直接运行文件 **C:\\\\Pixhawk_Toolchain\\\\toolchain\\\\msys\\\\1.0\\\\px4_eclipse.bat**"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:42
#: 60ad05367b274756b84b2f68372ec7f5
msgid "Creating the Project"
msgstr "创建项目"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:44
#: d71513df79ed4de9af7a07ba1d46c673
msgid "The project can be created by doing the following:"
msgstr "可通过以下步骤创建项目："

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:46
#: f57f22a85f324ef7b1a0ed59106750d0
msgid "Select **File \\| New \\| Make Project with Existing Code**"
msgstr "选择 **File \\| New \\| Make Project with Existing Code**"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:47
#: 1c6da7f1cc204027a9843edb6478bfd1
msgid ""
"Fill in the Project Name and set the *Existing Code Location* to the Copter "
"directory"
msgstr "填写项目名称，并将 *Existing Code Location* 设置为 Copter 目录"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:49
#: 3187fbd0310a48d09874ada9523e5cd6
msgid "Set the Toolchain to be *Cross GCC*\" and press **Finish**"
msgstr "将工具链设置为 *Cross GCC*，然后按 **Finish**"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:55
#: 4075b3969d6f43cc9f483138bae16333
msgid "Use spaces instead of tabs"
msgstr "使用空格代替制表符"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:57
#: 115b3e8436454b4f9046fb6a3acbb913
msgid ""
"By default Copter, Plane and Rover use spaces in place of tabs. This can be "
"set to the default in Eclipse by changing two settings:"
msgstr "Copter、Plane 和 Rover 默认使用空格代替制表符。在 Eclipse 中可通过修改以下两个设置将其设为默认："

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:60
#: 71cf0f6914814eee8c7495b835bcf065
msgid ""
"Select **Window \\| Preferences \\| General \\| Editors \\| Text Editors \\|"
" Insert spaces for tabs**."
msgstr ""
"选择 **Window \\| Preferences \\| General \\| Editors \\| Text Editors \\| "
"Insert spaces for tabs**。"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:66
#: 5b895cbae62a4e57a734676ffc5b849b
msgid ""
"Select **Windows \\| Preferences \\| C/C++ \\| Code Style \\| Formatter** "
"and creating a new Profile (i.e. \"K&R Tab\") which has the \"Indentation\" "
"set to \"Spaces only\""
msgstr ""
"选择 **Windows \\| Preferences \\| C/C++ \\| Code Style \\| "
"Formatter**，创建一个新配置文件（例如「K&R Tab」），并将「Indentation」设置为「Spaces only」"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:74
#: f680d5d3c6bc428e99e71d371dc09304
msgid "Specify build location"
msgstr "指定构建位置"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:76
#: 3e26beea509b4378b054f9b54311da2e
msgid ""
"In the *Project Explorer* right-mouse-click on the ardupilot folder and "
"select **Properties**. Then under C/C++ Build set the \"Build location\" to "
"the Copter or Plane directory as shown below."
msgstr ""
"在 *Project Explorer* 中右键点击 ardupilot 文件夹并选择 **Properties**。然后在 C/C++ Build "
"下将「Build location」设置为如下所示的 Copter 或 Plane 目录。"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:84
#: ffd2f166034647d69fec8de0f002f5c6
msgid "Specify make targets"
msgstr "指定 make 目标"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:86
#: 5ea7b6e7731945669c1fc6bb2a9f0c51
msgid ""
"In the Make window on the right create any of these make targets (the full "
"list of possible targets can be found in `px4_targets.mk "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/mk/px4_targets.mk>`__):"
msgstr ""
"在右侧的 Make 窗口中创建以下任意 make 目标（完整的可用目标列表见 `px4_targets.mk "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/mk/px4_targets.mk>`__）："

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:91
#: 1705ec17927e4aca8030606f17fcf6b5
msgid "``make px4``"
msgstr "``make px4``"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:91
#: 5ad90150c40d4c0590accd80bdd9f7f4
msgid "Build both PX4 and PixHawk firmware for a quadcopter"
msgstr "为四旋翼飞行器构建 PX4 和 PixHawk 固件"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:94
#: 2d5cbc0224954e5c91a4e4f84061d1c3
msgid "``make px4-v2``"
msgstr "``make px4-v2``"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:94
#: d0cf999922c24bb6801031861138e3ad
msgid ""
"Build the Pixhawk firmware for a copter. in the new version you can specify "
"the frame type (quad, hexa, octo) after flashing the pixhawk"
msgstr "为旋翼机构建 Pixhawk 固件。在新版本中，您可以在烧写 Pixhawk 后指定机架类型（quad、hexa、octo）"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:99
#: 874b18aca7124ba89b5851d6d040a64f
msgid "``make clean``"
msgstr "``make clean``"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:99
#: 9197fe58404d4dfabceefdb2e580e784
msgid "\"clean\" the ardupilot directory"
msgstr "「清理」ardupilot 目录"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:101
#: f18642ca8243485b86f4d00f69e3d200
msgid "``make px4-clean``"
msgstr "``make px4-clean``"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:101
#: 621b66baac9346219187496658a14ab9
msgid ""
"\"clean\" the PX4Firmware and PX4NuttX directories so the next build will "
"completely rebuild them"
msgstr "「清理」PX4Firmware 和 PX4NuttX 目录，以便下次构建时完全重新构建"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:105
#: 906561b3ec4a457aae7f052c4c66e8bc
msgid "``make px4-v2-upload``"
msgstr "``make px4-v2-upload``"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:105
#: cdcaf521dd0a4ec5876ed775d04eadbe
msgid ""
"Build and upload the Pixhawk firmware for a quad (i.e. no need to do step #7"
" below)"
msgstr "构建并上传四旋翼飞行器的 Pixhawk 固件（即无需执行下面的第 7 步）"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:110
#: 6495cc9b9c1046b0af838ddb0b1c0169
msgid ""
"For example, the image below shows how you might define a ``px4-v2`` make "
"target."
msgstr "例如，下图展示了如何定义一个 ``px4-v2`` make 目标。"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:118
#: 82c92bfd65d54899adeaf76f45c567a9
msgid "Building from Eclipse"
msgstr "从 Eclipse 构建"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:120
#: 71f39a2eb6264d9598aad64bd12933f8
msgid ""
"The make target can be built by pushing the green circle + hammer icon. The "
"build progress will appear in the Console window."
msgstr "可通过点击绿色圆圈加锤子图标来构建 make 目标。构建进度将显示在 Console 窗口中。"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-eclipse.rst:126
#: 278fdcaffce949609f15b7a247ea8386
msgid ""
"The firmware will be created in the vehicle directory (e.g. ArduCopter) and "
"have the file extension **.px4**."
msgstr "固件将在载具目录（如 ArduCopter）中生成，文件扩展名为 **.px4**。"
